[{"title":"伍有开著园丁以小艇载木芙蓉数株惠植小园 其三","author":"李孙宸","text":"怀人偏念小开子，悲秋犹惜木芙蓉。\n花到草堂人尚远，可能载酒一过从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29821,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春分日梅花一树盛开期伍有开过赏 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"二月江南尽落梅，春光曾不到春来。\n谁怜桃李花都尽，犹领春风向我开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29822,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春分日梅花一树盛开期伍有开过赏 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"闻君驼岭号梅林，几株能那岁寒心。\n若问吾园何得尔，祇缘幽寂客稀寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29823,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春分日梅花一树盛开期伍有开过赏 其三","author":"李孙宸","text":"春暖家家梅子肥，梅花奇绝正芳菲。\n醉来纵作师雄梦，不怕寒风冷客衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29824,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春分日梅花一树盛开期伍有开过赏 其四","author":"李孙宸","text":"与君虚度几花时，花落花开总未知。\n若使此花还错过，百年那有赏花期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29825,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠百岁翁游慕榕 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"谁信兹翁已百年，两眸如霓舌如泉。\n凭翁细问五朝事，一一谈来在眼前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29826,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠百岁翁游慕榕 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"南山松柏老龙鳞，朝菌宁知秋与春。\n除却前头周甲子，四旬也阅过多人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29827,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠百岁翁游慕榕 其三","author":"李孙宸","text":"谁言大药有仙传，试就兹翁问大年。\n道是年年随日过，饥时吃饭倦时眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29828,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕仙祠 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"炎夏长途马欲疲，道傍少憩吕翁祠。\n墙头几缕炊烟起，疑是黄梁未熟时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29829,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕仙祠 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"孰是凡人孰是仙，相逢总是梦中缘。\n凭翁自觅邯郸枕，看取轮回大劫年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29830,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕仙祠 其三","author":"李孙宸","text":"谁道荣名事不真，梦中晷刻亦前因。\n书生原是机锋捷，未必仙翁解度人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29831,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日过范蠡湖有怀故园风物 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"琴奏南薰五月风，江南气候总应同。\n不知江畔如花女，几队仙裳上画艟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29832,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日过范蠡湖有怀故园风物 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"又是分蒲撷艾辰，年光容易误游人。\n谁怜范蠡湖边渡，不见江南五月春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29833,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日过范蠡湖有怀故园风物 其三","author":"李孙宸","text":"五彩兰桡滚浪飞，击鼍舟子碧霞衣。\n中流乱入鲛绡室，亲见龙王爱女归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日过范蠡湖有怀故园风物 其四","author":"李孙宸","text":"梅矶晚泊醉名娃，袅袅新腔出缝纱。\n归棹石尤风浪逆，隔船唤买素馨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日过范蠡湖有怀故园风物 其五","author":"李孙宸","text":"海戏江南天下稀，朝朝竞斗水龙飞。\n鸣钲一诧千桡举，采喝中流夺锦归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日过范蠡湖有怀故园风物 其六","author":"李孙宸","text":"兰舟龙舸满城隅，最是时平乐事殊。\n近日青州报烽火，家家应系辟兵符。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春四首 其一 春服既成","author":"李孙宸","text":"时序递来还递往，人事随适亦随缘。\n重裘卸后衣单袷，便是春服所宜然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春四首 其二 浴乎沂","author":"李孙宸","text":"天地有水水有沂，一浴亦何预人事。\n狂士偶然兴会心，留与今人问沂水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春四首 其三 风乎舞雩","author":"李孙宸","text":"流光何处不供閒，眼见春光去复还。\n当日登临不可作，舞雩千古在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春四首 其四 咏而归","author":"李孙宸","text":"达观原在八极外，得趣自足一区中。\n任取有馀还造物，行歌五答思无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜闻歌","author":"李孙宸","text":"春星灼烁月华光，一曲凉州独擅场。\n按拍新声传乐府，绕梁清韵杂流商。\n乍来庭院梅花落，半入云霄子夜长。\n醉里倚栏听不足，早莺惊起解调簧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺","author":"李孙宸","text":"金风披拂绣罗裳，吹我相思到异乡。\n不见铁衣辞雁塞，仍闻鼙鼓戍渔阳。\n合欢裛露开盈砌，促织惊寒鸣近床。\n最怪流黄机上月，秋来偏照瓦鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过朱季美池馆 其一","author":"李孙宸","text":"春光淑气转氤氲，步入桥西一访君。\n地迥有风偏响竹，冈寒无雨亦生云。\n閒情偏洽尊中赏，高调难将世上闻。\n指点墨池誇胜事，晚烟笼处乱鹅群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过朱季美池馆 其二","author":"李孙宸","text":"篙人未夕驻兰桡，七十峰边夜听潮。\n山水生来怜有分，云霞到处解相招。\n风含瀑布疑环佩，峡束江声似洞箫。\n未信出山为小草，与君天际且逍遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"炼丹灶","author":"李孙宸","text":"相传丹灶此中开，炼取刀圭藁上裁。\n一自仙翁冲举后，尚馀灵气隐莓苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏玉溪园八景 其一 竹间亭","author":"李孙宸","text":"伐木结小亭，遂在此林下。\n倘有子献来，清阴堪共把。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏玉溪园八景 其二 醉石","author":"李孙宸","text":"兹石不解酒，偏饶饮者意。\n若无清音夜，输却一旬春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古冈八景选四 其一 黄云樵笛","author":"何龙祯","text":"深山深不极，地道远黄云。\n姓字迷幽帅，笛声何处闻。\n正襟无是伴，危坐若无群。\n代木依谁者，执柯应与君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古冈八景选四 其二 紫水渔舟","author":"何龙祯","text":"荒榛迷远道，潮长海鸥稀。\n休讶逢人少，应知与世违。\n桃源悲路渺，紫水亦相依。\n欸乃数声急，隔江鱼羡肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古冈八景选四 其三 能海归帆","author":"何龙祯","text":"谁知波浪满前途，到处闻来消息殊。\n水浅沙寒鱼不饵，停舟晚薄客心孤。\n风吹古径花盈树，水满长江月在湖。\n人道故园景物好，笑同归去莫踌躇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古冈八景选四 其四 江门晚渡","author":"何龙祯","text":"白沙芳迹重徘徊，试上先生旧钓台。\n嘉会楼前花拂路，小庐山外月如杯。\n使臣去后半荒草，鸟鹊啼时惊落梅。\n晚棹欲归归未忍，莫教稚子频相催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因误用邮符入滇议调父老拥道泣留不得行为赋二律 其一","author":"何龙祯","text":"自惭薄劣应投林，父老何因依恋深。\n卧辙几挥痛哭泪，攀辕叠写哀鸣音。\n甘棠遗泽殊亏昔，蛮海怀音又见今。\n身世机缘难上道，权留数月慰舆心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因误用邮符入滇议调父老拥道泣留不得行为赋二律 其二","author":"何龙祯","text":"一奉严纶返故林，无如苍赤系情深。\n相依未许歌骊曲，对镜惟喧投辖音。\n宦迹去来原自古，滇云惨淡独伤今。\n独怜南国甘棠意，愧我莫酬物望心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢两院题留","author":"何龙祯","text":"二十年来逐宦游，惊看白发渐盈头。\n只应林壑侣云鹤，岂合凤尘恋豸驺。\n荐牍无劳旦夕上，归心不复须臾留。\n庙廊湖海从今隔，为谢中台爱惜周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大宁公馆夜宿","author":"吴殿邦","text":"寒山一路草荒荒，入宿邮亭又夕阳。\n半醉布衾凉似水，五更木柝紧敲霜。\n偷灯野鼠缘茅榻，叫月村鸡闹竹墙。\n聊与奚童成短梦，天涯马足为谁忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮秋匏谷结社有赋得园字","author":"吴殿邦","text":"海门东去听潮喧，落得便宜五石樽。\n旅雁相过排晚字，群鸥坐对领卮言。\n清狂我辈簪原合，懒拙畸人薜自扪。\n生计只今诗酒在，未应萧瑟此山园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫题","author":"吴殿邦","text":"家在飞泉玉简峰，草亭经日对杉松。\n晴岚秋壑无人到，惟有风篁乱石淙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衰柳","author":"吴殿邦","text":"踰淮衰柳楼长亭，为问当年几回荣。\n拂地如烟枝有态，漫天作雪絮无情。\n留连行色萧萧马，恼乱春愁恰恰莺。\n夹道只今憔悴甚，宁知松柏岁寒盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佚题","author":"吴殿邦","text":"鸟声花气满山溪，中有山翁醉似泥。\n诗思欲狂邀不得，粉墙石壁浑漫题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前题","author":"欧莒","text":"浮云渐远净河山，白社追欢恣往还。\n既可掀髯谈世外，不妨把臂傲林间。\n贻将兰茝薰衿佩，拂却尘埃驻镜颜。\n文藻有灵邀此日，从容吟就大巫删。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和洪启进游崆峒岩","author":"尹璿","text":"岁杪寻若杜若洲，崆峒岩畔紫烟浮。\n杯传柏叶香生煖，石滴泉花意自幽。\n苔藓濛濛晴似雨，云霞冉冉夏疑秋。\n华鸱白鹿还堪拟，勾漏黄龙人望收。\n览胜不妨风落帽，登山岂惮雪侵裘。\n使君问俗凭清假，折柬招携喜共游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春游环谷","author":"朱完","text":"岭南地暖三阳早，春入郊原美芳草。\n携筇步出郭北门，和风丽日春光好。\n无客同游唯两儿，大儿矫健能追随。\n小儿九龄好游嬉，飞扬跋扈挈人衣。\n旧卜山庄在环谷，峻岭层峦多古木。\n巉岩怪石出清泉，错落名花间修竹。\n我来汲水试新茶，团团碧露覆黄芽。\n甘冽令人清神骨，中泠石井徒尔誇。\n啜罢低回陇亩侧，指点艰难是稼穑。\n荒冢松柏易摧残，往事兴亡同叹息。\n缓步长歌意悠然，家僮随后汲山泉。\n小者负具力难前，且行且止故迁延。\n牛羊各散群动息，归望城头日已夕。\n候门稚子欢相迎，娟娟新月林间出。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山园漫兴 其一","author":"朱完","text":"绕屋桑田百亩，当门松树千株。\n墙东墙西蝴蝶，山北山南鹧鸪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山园漫兴 其二","author":"朱完","text":"石上风摇薜荔，花门雨滑苍苔。\n新蝉响断还续，暮鸟飞去复来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山园漫兴 其三","author":"朱完","text":"僧来有时鸣磬，客去经旬闭关。\n夜雨飞泉百道，秋风落落千山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山园漫兴 其四","author":"朱完","text":"石上流泉饮鹿，云中茅屋鸣鸡。\n幽人策杖何去，采药菖蒲寺西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山园漫兴 其五","author":"朱完","text":"性懒逢迎渐少，山深幽趣偏多。\n呼童移花移石，对酒自酌自歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺怨","author":"朱完","text":"少年轻薄何去，几载音书未通。\n江头朝朝暮暮，愁中雨雨风风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日山行","author":"朱完","text":"荒郊重阳极望，霜叶千山尽红。\n垒垒何人古墓，年年此日悲风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山飞来寺","author":"朱完","text":"传闻中宿寺，今始一登临。\n雨过前溪合，云连古洞深。\n猿声纷绝壁，僧梵度疏林。\n得睹空王宇，因知出世心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张太傅墓","author":"苏复生","text":"太傅忠魂何处寻，平章海曲昼常阴。\n春深孤冢荆榛合，雨积残碑薜荔侵。\n文陆死生俱饮恨，臼婴先后实同心。\n独怜岁月倾祠庙，回首踟躇泪满襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖光岩","author":"陈其峨","text":"谁人凿破混沌初，剖向天南作镜湖。\n沙白水清鱼可数，岩深树古鸟相呼。\n重笼长住西来佛，断碣犹题宋大苏。\n常见蟠龙潭内起，白牛之说有之无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西樵山","author":"孙光祚","text":"海上留仙岛，如从物外游。\n风回烟景换，溪转水声幽。\n涧石和云煮，山茶带露收。\n门无催税吏，何必觅丹丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观音岩","author":"张问政","text":"蓬壶碧落岭云东，灵鹫飞来面面同。\n莫道穿山无佛法，分明鞭石有奇功。\n因寻狮子香台远，拾得莲花玉洞中。\n不是慈航开宝筏，阴厓那许一灯通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菩提树","author":"罗宾王","text":"灵根渡海来，间关自天竺。\n荫此旃檀林，枝柯贞以肃。\n日日荡其光，宁为造化育。\n回视梁唐春，荣枯成一宿。\n百草皆有生，百草皆有欲。\n安得群物心，忘情若斯木。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居答徐巢友","author":"罗宾王","text":"造化愿人少，百草无停春。\n遇物辄生叹，终非葛天民。\n胡为乡与土，颦笑厌我真。\n草草百年内，相逢几醉人。\n何如玄洲子，金玉同灰尘。\n怡情在山水，天地爱其贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏迟社中诸子","author":"罗宾王","text":"古巷扃萝雨，墙花隔路尘。\n闭门聊学圃，移竹待过人。\n剪绿怀新果，留红惜去春。\n时艰轻聚散，相见莫辞频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈云丈室春日喜双燕来巢","author":"罗宾王","text":"岂无城市好，爱此近禅林。\n择处偏多意，栖迟见尔心。\n炉香同昼永，灯火一帘深。\n来岁还相访，云中认磬音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕雨雪时客并州","author":"罗宾王","text":"客舍三更火，天涯两岁身。\n雪留今夜腊，雨报隔年春。\n薄醉存寒意，明灯见发新。\n遥怜儿女夕，能解忆游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明后一日同诸子踏青","author":"罗宾王","text":"清明才过日，万绿已归林。\n更踏路边草，难为行客心。\n白云遥望杳，古木向人深。\n岁岁春还暮，青山独至今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日寄送友人入蜀","author":"罗宾王","text":"日暮溪风吹女萝，故人西去近如何。\n黄陵庙口芦花落，白帝城边秋草多。\n失路自惭监骥泣，途穷谁听饭牛歌。\n停鞭为问邛崃道，九折曾经几客过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐州戏马台","author":"罗宾王","text":"鸿沟分据楚天开，一吒横鞭独上台。\n濉水漫誇调马去，砀山谁信斩蛇回。\n孤城日落寒烟积，古渡人归暮角催。\n南望长桥莫回首，隔河空见雁飞来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门","author":"罗宾王","text":"访古娄江万木疏，夕阳西下几丘墟。\n谁人却傍要离冢，有客还探大禹书。\n鹤市只今犹泣玉，酒城无复过游车。\n吴门亦有逃名者，何事吹箫向阖闾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏台","author":"罗宾王","text":"登台日春上姑苏，吴越江山半绿芜。\n旧苑有时游野鹿，扁舟何日复归湖。\n采香径冷花空落，响屧廊空月自孤。\n欲向胥涛问流水，恨随沧海几时枯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"罗宾王","text":"看花三月到湖西，湖草青青水拍堤。\n两岸绿遮游马去，六桥红暗画船齐。\n竹枝歌散荒陵冷，月笛吹残故苑低。\n独有杜鹃春不住，度江犹向汴梁啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄徐巢友游二禺","author":"罗宾王","text":"寄览何知老大艰，游踪不定二禺间。\n寒江急急舟横水，夜雨潇潇人扣关。\n古木傲云惟卧石，秋风爱客又还山。\n磨崖读遍飞空字，定有猿归献玉环。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同肄僧夜话时僧亦下狱","author":"罗宾王","text":"焰焰孤灯挂壁偏，铁围深锁半檐天。\n墙花夜落重沟水，梁月寒归古殿烟。\n鞭石久驱秦日月，射潮谁捍粤山川。\n老僧不解兴亡事，数记楞严第几篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花田","author":"罗宾王","text":"素馨花发月如烟，一缕香云起暮田。\n长恨渡头东逝水，年年空送卖花船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":29889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]